{"id":"d671aa63fca8d973","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-reflection-unprovable.md","title":"Reflection Unprovable","display":"thm-reflection-unprovable — Reflection Unprovable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-reflection-unprovable","aliases":["92-thm-reflection-unprovable"],"display":"thm-reflection-unprovable — Reflection Unprovable","depends_on":["[[92-df-reflection-principle]]","[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-local-reflection]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-reflection-unprovable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-reflection-unprovable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reflection-unprovable — Reflection Unprovable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1ea2ee34667cb5dd\" href=\"?note=1ea2ee34667cb5dd\" title=\"92-df-reflection-principle\">92-df-reflection-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"57ea3ea286817df3\" href=\"?note=57ea3ea286817df3\" title=\"92-thm-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-second-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"762abc58e37c6f85\" href=\"?note=762abc58e37c6f85\" title=\"92-df-local-reflection\">92-df-local-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (the fixed PA system)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (external consistency and its internal sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> (fixed contradiction sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rfn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{rfn}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\)</span> (local instance constructor and full local-reflection schema)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}unprovable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\\in\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\n\\land G\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_G\\bigr)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}unprovable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\\in\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\n\\land G\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_G\\bigr)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>至少一个局部反射实例在相容的固定系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中不可证</li>\n<li>取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\bot_G\">\\(\\varphi=\\bot_G\\)</span>所得实例是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G\\)</span>；它与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>可证等价，但因<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span>是原始连接词，二者不必字面相同</li>\n<li>第二不完备性保证这两个可证等价的句子均不可证</li>\n<li>因而不能说“每个实例可能可证”；至少这一实例在相容<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>中不可证</li>\n<li>反射原理分层</li>\n<li>整个局部反射模式通常强于单个一致性句；本断言只隔离其中与一致性对应的一条实例</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"1ea2ee34667cb5dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"57ea3ea286817df3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-local-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"762abc58e37c6f85","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-local-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-contradiction","status":"resolved","id":"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-contradiction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rfn}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}unprovable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\\in\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\n\\land G\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_G\\bigr)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi=\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1748,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-ch-independence.md]]\n[[92-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[92-thm-completeness-fo.md]]\n[[92-thm